From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mfreadwrite: Sink writer input types and Finalize, reader transforms.

IMFSinkWriter::SetInputMediaType inserts a converter or encoder (or a
chain) when the sink does not take the type, samples are pushed through
them and drained, Finalize works synchronously and asynchronously with the
finalizable sink. The source reader gets SetNativeMediaType,
AddTransformForStream and RemoveAllTransformsForStream, and
CreateInstanceFromURL honours riid and fails with E_FAIL for unknown
classes.
---
 dlls/mfreadwrite/reader.c | 215 +++++++++++++++++-
 dlls/mfreadwrite/writer.c | 545 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 742 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

